      "Text": "Security update for libsoup",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libsoup fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-0716: out-of-bounds read when processing a crafted unmasked frame with a payload length near `UINT64_MAX`\n  sent by a WebSocket server (bsc#1256418).\n",
